          "views": 4691
        },
        {
          "id": "2095530450173186073",
          "text": "Ian Cunningham joked \"it feels like every player you look at is from Georgia,\" but his tallest — &amp; heaviest — defensive addition ties back to his Chicago roots.\n\nGervon Dexter Sr. is \"big, strong, powerful, explosive,\" &amp; fits the Fa",
