          "created": "Thu Sep 03 15:12:47 +0000 2026",
          "likes": 44,
          "rts": 4,
          "replies": 1,
          "views": 2683
        },
        {
          "id": "2095592523901149345",
          "text": "The Falcons named five captains. Kevin Stefanski said earlier in camp they have an abundance of good leaders.\n\n“You don’t need the ‘C’ on your chest in order to lead. You don’t. You can be yourself and give a great example to young players,",
          "url": "https://x.com/ByDanielFlick/status/2095592523901149345",
          "created": "Thu Sep 03 19:19:26 +0000 2026",
          "likes": 43,
          "rts": 3,
